      Independent Consultant, Oslo, Norway

repository-code: "https://github.com/mary-032/pv-validation-idaice-pvsyst"

url: "https://github.com/mary-032/pv-validation-idaice-pvsyst"

abstract: >-
  Reproducible data-processing, validation, uncertainty, sensitivity,
  and figure-generation workflow for comparing photovoltaic simulations
  in IDA ICE and PVsyst against measured data from three PV systems in
  Borås, Sweden. The repository accompanies the study "Validation of PV
  Modeling in an Integrated Building Energy Simulation Tool" and includes
  annual unshaded validation, near-field shading analysis, moving-block
  bootstrap uncertainty analysis, reverse-transposition sensitivity,
  measurement-uncertainty sensitivity, temporal-aggregation sensitivity,
  and weather-condition sensitivity analyses.

keywords:
  - photovoltaic
  - PV simulation
  - IDA ICE
  - PVsyst
  - building energy simulation
  - BIPV
  - model validation
  - uncertainty analysis
  - solar irradiance
  - reproducibility
